.\"	$NetBSD$
.\"
.Dd October 18, 2026
.Dt NEWFS_APFS 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm newfs_apfs
.Nd construct a new Apple File System (APFS)
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl v Ar volume_name
.Ar device
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility creates an APFS container on the specified
.Ar device .
.Pp
The following options are available:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl v Ar volume_name
Specify the name of the initial APFS volume.
If not specified, "Untitled" is used.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mount_apfs 8 ,
.Xr newfs 8
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
utility first appeared in NetBSD 11.0.
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Junie Aq
